<rte name="Estimating Considerations" id="com.ey.task.estimate" nodeId="4e8e88af">&lt;p&gt;
    Time-box sprint planning meetings to 2 hours for a week-long sprint, the length of a sprint can vary so increase time
    allocated to sprint planning by 2 hours for each additional week in a sprint. For example:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        1 week sprint: 2 hours of sprint planning
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        2 week sprint: 4 hours of sprint planning
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        3 week sprint: 6 hours of sprint planning&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</rte>
<rte name="Default Duration (Hours)" id="com.ey.task.hours" nodeId="41bf80dd"></rte>
